03:00","position":16,"updated_at":"2025-12-21T22:46:02-03:00","product_id":10799120482497,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0823\/7953\/8625\/files\/Protector_Parts_11.png?v=1766367962","width":1600,"height":1600}],"options":[{"name":"Color","position":1,"values":["Somente a Ponteira SC Project (Preto)","Somente a Ponteira SC Project (Inox)","Somente a Ponteira SC Project (Titânio Azulado)","Escapamento Completo SC Project (Cor da ponteira \u0026 coletor após a finalização)"]}]},{"id":10998559342785,"title":"Coletor SC Project Yamaha YZF R15 | Somente o Coletor","handle":"coletor-sc-project-yamaha-yzf-r15-somente-o-coletor","body_html":"\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"ql-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003eSobre os Escapes:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eO escapamento \u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"195\" data-end=\"209\"\u003eSC Project\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e é uma das referências no mundo das motos esportivas. Nascido nas pistas, ele traz o visual agressivo e o desempenho típico das competições de alto nível. Para a \u003cstrong data-start=\"371\" data-end=\"385\"\u003eYamaha R15\u003c\/strong\u003e, o modelo é adaptado para entregar \u003cstrong data-start=\"421\" data-end=\"455\"\u003eestilo, leveza e som encorpado\u003c\/strong\u003e, sem precisar alterar outras partes da moto. Ideal para quem busca um upgrade de presença e performance com visual \u003cstrong data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"581\"\u003eracing\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"ql-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003eCaracterísticas principais:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1684\" data-start=\"1658\"\u003e✅ \u003c\/strong\u003eDesign esportivo e agressivo, com ponteira curta e acabamento premium\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1684\" data-start=\"1658\"\u003e✅ \u003c\/strong\u003eConstrução em \u003cstrong data-end=\"378\" data-start=\"360\"\u003eaço inoxidável\u003c\/strong\u003e ou \u003cstrong data-end=\"402\" data-start=\"382\"\u003efibra de carbono\u003c\/strong\u003e, dependendo do modelo\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"443\" data-start=\"429\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1684\" data-start=\"1658\"\u003e✅ \u003c\/strong\u003eSoldas TIG\u003c\/strong\u003e de alta precisão\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"488\" data-start=\"465\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1684\" data-start=\"1658\"\u003e✅ \u003c\/strong\u003eDB Killer removível\u003c\/strong\u003e (controle do som)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1684\" data-start=\"1658\"\u003e✅ \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEstilo\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003cstrong data-end=\"528\" data-start=\"518\"\u003eracing\u003c\/strong\u003e, inspirado em modelos usados na MotoGP\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1684\" data-start=\"1658\"\u003e✅ \u003c\/strong\u003ePonteira com acabamento refinado (\u003cstrong\u003eT\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1041\" data-start=\"1010\"\u003eitânio\u003c\/strong\u003e)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1684\" data-start=\"1658\"\u003e✅ \u003c\/strong\u003eSom mais limpo, encorpado e com assinatura característica da marca\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1684\" data-start=\"1658\"\u003e✅ \u003c\/strong\u003eModelo \u003cstrong data-end=\"1140\" data-start=\"1125\"\u003eFull System\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1684\" data-start=\"1658\"\u003e✅ \u003c\/strong\u003eExcelente dissipação térmica\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1228\" data-start=\"1207\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1684\" data-start=\"1658\"\u003e✅ \u003c\/strong\u003eAlta durabilidade\u003c\/strong\u003e e resistência a altas temperaturas\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"ql-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003eAjuda na performance?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eSim,\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1597\" data-start=\"1581\"\u003e Ajudam\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e na performance da \u003cem\u003eYamaha R15\u003c\/em\u003e, especialmente em termos de:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1684\" data-start=\"1658\"\u003e✅ Aceleração mais rápida\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1706\" data-start=\"1687\"\u003e✅ Redução de peso\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1741\" data-start=\"1709\"\u003e✅ Melhora na resposta do motor\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1775\" data-start=\"1744\"\u003e✅ Visual e som mais esportivo\u003cbr\u003e✅ Mais CV de potência\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eSão upgrades ideais para quem quer mais estilo e desempenho \u003cstrong data-end=\"1858\" data-start=\"1837\"\u003esem abrir o motor\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca rel=\"noopener\" href=\"http:\/\/api.whatsapp.com\/send\/?phone=5532991042903\u0026amp;text=Gostaria+de+Tirar+uma+D%C3%BAvida!\u0026amp;type=phone_number\u0026amp;app_absent=0\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cimg style=\"float: none;\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0823\/7953\/8625\/files\/imagem_2025-04-17_225124829_600x600.png?v=1744941111\"\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg style=\"margin-top: -7px; margin-bottom: -7px; float: none;\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0823\/7953\/8625\/files\/Frete_Gratis_1.png?v=1744940078\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","published_at":"2026-06-10T11:51:35-03:00","created_at":"2026-06-10T11:51:35-03:00","updated_at":"2026-10-15T11:01:04-03:00","vendor":"Sandim R15","product_type":"","tags":["Acessórios r15 v3"],"variants":[{"id":50317913751745,"title":"Somente Cole